cff-version: 1.2.0
message: 'If you wish to cite the "pymaskinporten" package use:'
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
title: 'pymaskinporten: a python library for fetching Maskinporten tokens'
version: 2.0.1
abstract: >-
  pymaskinporten is a Python library that simplifies the process of obtaining
  Maskinporten tokens for secure API access. It provides an easy-to-use
  interface for developers to authenticate and retrieve tokens, enabling
  seamless integration with services that require Maskinporten authentication.
